:: Carter House Go Somewhere [nobr]

<<set _ad to [
    {
        Name: "Carter",
        State: {
			Outfit: "Everyday",
			Mouth: "Happy",
    	},	
    },
	{
      	Name: "Player",
        State: {
			Mouth: "Happy",
    	},	
    },
]>>
    <<ad _ad>>
You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> if he would like to go somewhere. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Yeah! Lemme just let someone know.”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:Yellow">Where?</span><br>
<<set $HangOutClothes to "Everyday">>
<<link"The Park (0:10)<br>">>
    <<set $Minutes += 10>>
    <<goto "Carter Hang Out Go To Park">>
<</link>>
<<link"The Arcade (0:05)<br>">>
    <<set $Minutes += 5>>
    <<goto "Carter Hang Out Arcade Intro">>
<</link>>
<<link"The Mall (0:15)<br>">>
    <<set $Minutes += 15>>
    <<goto "Carter Hang Out Mall Intro">>
<</link>>

